Implement user story SKY-004-a: Express server routes, middleware, and static dashboard

## Story Description
Implement src/server.ts with all Express routes (/health, /search, /cheapest, /), RAPIDAPI_KEY gating middleware, error handling, and src/public/index.html dashboard. Export `app` separately from listen() with main-module guard. Import FlightResult from SKY-002.

## Acceptance Criteria
- src/server.ts exports named `app` (Express instance) separately from listen(); listen() guarded by main-module check (ESM or CJS form matching build output) so supertest import never binds a port
- GET /health → 200, Content-Type application/json, { status: 'ok', uptime: <positive number> }; returns 200 regardless of RAPIDAPI_KEY presence
- GET / → 200, Content-Type text/html, body equals contents of src/public/index.html read via fs.readFileSync at runtime — no hardcoded inline HTML string; never gated by RAPIDAPI_KEY
- src/public/index.html exists as a styled single-page dashboard: full-width solid-color header (e.g. #1a73e8) with bold white 'Skyscanner Dashboard' title + subtitle; centered white card (max-width ~700px, rounded, bordered, padded) with 2-column grid form (From IATA + To IATA row 1, Date + Adults row 2, each with label); full-width colored search button; status area (light-red error banner, gray empty message, success count); client-side JS submits GET /search without page reload, disables button during fetch, renders flight results table inline
- GET /search with valid from/to/date/adults → 200 { flights: FlightResult[], count: number, searchedAt: string } where count === flights.length; searchedAt is ISO-8601 reflecting request time, distinct for requests ≥1ms apart
- GET /search missing any of from/to/date → 400 { error: string }; adults absent → defaults to 1 (200); adults non-numeric (e.g. 'abc', '') → 400 { error: string }
- GET /cheapest with valid from/to/date → 200 single FlightResult with lowest price (adults forwarded or defaults to 1); empty client response → 404 { error: string }; missing any of from/to/date → 400 { error: string }
- RAPIDAPI_KEY absent at startup → middleware short-circuits /search and /cheapest with 503 { error: 'RAPIDAPI_KEY not configured' }; SkyscannerClient throws → 500 { error: string }, no crash or unhandled rejection; FlightResult type imported from SKY-002 export, not redeclared inline





